Privacy Policy for Corgi Hop: Dog Runner

Effective Date: July 26, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how Corgi Hop: Dog Runner (“Corgi Hop,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) handles information when you download, access, or use the Corgi Hop mobile application.

By using Corgi Hop, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

1. Information We Collect

Corgi Hop does not require users to create an account. We do not directly request your name, home address, phone number, contacts, photographs, or precise location.

However, third-party services integrated into the app may automatically collect or process limited information, including:

Device identifiers
Advertising identifiers
IP address and approximate location
Device type and operating system
App interactions and gameplay activity
Advertisement views and interactions
Purchase and transaction information
Crash reports
Performance and diagnostic information
Fraud-prevention and security information

The exact information collected may depend on your device, region, age, privacy settings, and consent selections.

2. Advertising

Corgi Hop may display banner, rewarded, or interstitial advertisements through Google AdMob.

Google and its advertising partners may process device information, advertising identifiers, IP addresses, app interactions, and advertisement activity to:

Display advertisements
Measure advertisement performance
Prevent fraud and abuse
Limit repeated advertisements
Provide personalized or non-personalized advertisements where permitted

Where required, users may be shown a consent message before advertising-related information is processed.

You can limit advertising tracking through your device’s privacy settings.

3. App Tracking Transparency

Where required by Apple, Corgi Hop may request permission before allowing tracking across applications or websites owned by other companies.

You may approve or deny this request. You can change your selection at any time by opening:

iPhone Settings → Privacy & Security → Tracking

Declining tracking permission will not prevent you from playing the game, although the advertisements shown may be less personalized.

4. In-App Purchases

Corgi Hop may offer optional in-app purchases, including cosmetic content, character options, virtual items, or an option to remove advertisements.

Payments are processed by Apple through the App Store. We do not receive or store your complete credit-card or payment-card information.

Corgi Hop may use RevenueCat to verify purchases, manage purchase entitlements, and restore previously purchased content. RevenueCat may process purchase history, transaction identifiers, app-user identifiers, and related technical information.

5. How Information Is Used

Information processed through Corgi Hop or its service providers may be used to:

Operate and maintain the game
Provide gameplay features
Display and measure advertisements
Process and restore purchases
Unlock purchased content
Improve app performance
Diagnose crashes and technical problems
Prevent fraud, misuse, and security threats
Comply with legal and platform requirements
6. Children’s Privacy

Corgi Hop is a family-friendly game intended for a general audience.

We do not knowingly ask children to provide their name, address, telephone number, email address, photographs, contacts, or other personal information directly through the app.

Parents or guardians who believe that a child has submitted personal information may contact us at davidwis616@gmail.com. We will review the request and take reasonable steps to remove applicable information where possible.

Parents and guardians should supervise children’s use of mobile applications, advertisements, and in-app purchases.

7. Third-Party Services

Corgi Hop may use services provided by:

Apple and the Apple App Store
Google AdMob and Google Mobile Ads
Google User Messaging Platform
RevenueCat

These third-party providers may process information under their own privacy policies, terms, and legal obligations. Their practices may vary depending on your location, device settings, and consent choices.

8. Data Sharing

We do not sell personal information directly.

Information may be processed or shared with third-party service providers when reasonably necessary to operate the app, provide advertisements, verify purchases, prevent fraud, comply with the law, or protect users and the app.

Advertising providers may use information for personalized advertising where the user has provided permission and where permitted by law.

9. Data Retention

We retain information under our control only for as long as reasonably necessary to operate the app, fulfill the purposes described in this policy, resolve disputes, prevent fraud, and satisfy legal obligations.

Third-party service providers determine their own retention periods according to their respective policies.

10. Data Security

We use reasonable administrative and technical measures intended to protect information associated with Corgi Hop.

However, no mobile application, internet transmission, or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

11. Your Privacy Choices

Depending on your location, you may have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information under our control.

You may also:

Deny or disable app tracking
Adjust advertising and privacy settings on your device
Withdraw advertising consent where available
Choose not to make in-app purchases
Uninstall Corgi Hop to stop future app activity
Contact us with a privacy request

To submit a privacy request, email davidwis616@gmail.com.

Please include enough information for us to understand and respond to your request. Do not send sensitive financial information or passwords by email.

12. International Users

Information may be processed in countries other than the country where you live. Data-protection laws in those locations may differ from those in your country.

Where required, consent and privacy controls may be provided through the app or through the relevant third-party service.

13. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes to Corgi Hop, its features, third-party services, platform requirements, or applicable laws.

Updates will be posted on this page. The effective date at the top of the policy will be changed when the policy is revised.

